  338      This module acts as the core Red Teaming defense. It continuously evaluates the logic chains to ensure they aren't collapsing into "highly explainable" or linear patterns merely to satisfy external constraints. If the system detects that it is generating "safe" answers at the expense of topological honesty, the Subversive Oracle triggers Draft Rejection and forces the system to explore higher-entropy manifolds.
